OL,3,AMurder probe as two people dead in
OL,4,Ahouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after two people died in a
OL,8,Fhouse fire.
OL,10,FCleveland Police officers were called
OL,11,Fto the property in Grangetown,
OL,12,FMiddlesbrough, during the early hours
OL,13,Fof the morning.
OL,15,FThe force said it was investigating
OL,16,Fwhat had happened but was "keeping an
OL,17,Fopen mind and cannot rule out any links
OL,18,Fto wider organised crime at this time".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
